{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QrnZQxUun86FMn1HJSPvHE","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 software and engineering firms). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| remote_share | Share of engineering staff working mostly remote, 2021-2022 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2023 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2023 |\n| log_engineers_2020 | Log number of engineers, 2020 |\n| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2020 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2020, standardized |\n| collab_index_2023 | Internal collaboration index from 2023 survey |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| segment | Sector: hardware / software |\n| vc_backed | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| founder_ceo | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| cloud_spend_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| hq_in_hub_city | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| share_phd_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| gross_margin_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of remote work on engineering innovation?\n\nApproach: OLS of patents_per_100_eng_2023 on remote_share with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I report the simple regression of the outcome on the treatment, which is transparent and easy to interpret, after trimming the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on remote_share is 1.316 (SE 0.217, p = 0.0000, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: positive effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"positive effect\",\n \"estimate\": 1.3156,\n \"std_error\": 0.2167,\n \"p_value\": 0.0,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=none; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}analysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66c88e39-6bed-4353-919c-8685c8889370","uuid":"9976a01c-6898-48ca-b42b-79614fc3be54"}
